ols-[4rem_1fr]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(13.1889px);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display text-5xl leading-[0.8] text-foreground/25\">01</span><section><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl uppercase leading-none sm:text-3xl\">Tell us early</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/80\">Give us at least 14 days' notice with the new address and move-in date. We'll check availability at the new property and book activation for the day you arrive.</p></section></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 border-t-[3px] border-foreground py-8 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 sm:grid-cols-[4rem_1fr]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display text-5xl leading-[0.8] text-foreground/25\">02</span><section><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl uppercase leading-none sm:text-3xl\">What if speed at the new address is slower?</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/80\">If the available service at the new address is materially different, OCCTA will explain the options. Any plan change, installation work, ETF or network charge depends on the accepted agreement and the service available at the new address.</p></section></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 border-t-[3px] border-foreground py-8 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 sm:grid-cols-[4rem_1fr]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display text-5xl leading-[0.8] text-foreground/25\">03</span><section><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl uppercase leading-none sm:text-3xl\">What if it's not available?</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/80\">We'll cancel without a fee. Genuinely — Price Lock 24 or Flex 30 where offered means Price Lock 24 or Flex 30 where offered.</p></section></div></div><aside class=\"space-y-5 lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start\"><section class=\"border-[3px] border-foreground bg-card\"><h2 class=\"border-b-[3px] border-foreground bg-primary 